# Production environment configuration
# Used by: npm run build (default production mode)
#
# This file is committed and contains only defaults.
# Copy .env.production.local.example to .env.production.local with your actual credentials.
#
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN (public, URL-restricted pk.* token for the /routes map) is
# provisioned via Infisical (/frontend) and exported into .env.production.local
# by `just deploy-web prod`. It is required for production builds (the build
# fails loudly if it's missing) — see packages/web/README.md "Mapbox token".
